'''Kotomine & Gilgamesh Cats''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. They were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

